        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana PH40, Solid Brass Pivot Hinge Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Deltana PH40 Fixed Pivot Hinge for Doors Up 70 lbs is packaged as a pair with matching finish #10 x 1\" wood screws. Each pair contains one left hand and one right hand pivot hinge. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-PH40-specifications.gif?v=1704354723\" width=\"533\" height=\"273\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana PH40 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/fixed-pivot-hinge-for-doors-up-35-lbs-deltana-ph35\"><b>Pivot Hinges for Doors Up to 35 lbs</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-pivot-hinge-for-doors-up-to-200-lbs-deltana-ph60\"><b>Pivot Hinges for Doors Up to 200 lbs</b></a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Standard Duty Fixed Pivot Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Size: 4-3/8\" x 5/8\" x 1-7/8\"</li> \r\n<li>Thickness: 3/8\"</li> \r\n<li>Load Capacity: 70 LB.</li> \r\n<li>Packaged as a pair containing one left hand and one right hand pivot hinge.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-PH40.pdf?v=1704262216\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana PH40 Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different <a href=\"/pages/deltana-finish-colors\" target=\"new\">finishes</a>, but no matter which finish you choose, the base metal will still be <b>High Quality Solid Brass</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Pair (2 Hinges, top and bottom for 1 door.)</b>\r\n</p>",
